@* Shows where the component's code runs: on the server (static SSR, Interactive Server) or in the browser (WebAssembly). *@
<p class="c-runtime">
    <span>Running on</span>
    <span class="c-runtime__value" data-testid="runtime">@(OperatingSystem.IsBrowser() ? "WebAssembly" : "Server")</span>
</p>
